Description: FastAPI microservice for splitting German compound words
 A small HTTP service which splits German compound words into their
 components. It is installed below /opt/german-word-splitter together with
 its own Python virtual environment and the German dictionary, and runs as
 a systemd service under the dedicated user and group german-word-splitter.
 Settings are read from /etc/default/german-word-splitter.
